1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,540
这节课的两个 notebook，都是授课老师跑过的
Two notebooks from this lecture, run by the instructors:

2
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:06,404
同样的数据 pipeline
the same data pipeline,

3
00:00:06,404 --> 00:00:10,539
同样的 1156 张奶酪照片，同样的五个模型
the same 1,156 cheese photos, the same five models.

4
00:00:10,859 --> 00:00:16,363
Notebook A 选出的冠军是微调过的 MobileNet，准确率 68.97%
Notebook A crowns the fine-tuned MobileNet, at 68.97 percent.

5
00:00:16,683 --> 00:00:22,708
Notebook B 选出的冠军是冻结的 MobileNet，也是 68.97%
Notebook B crowns the frozen MobileNet, also at 68.97 percent,

6
00:00:22,708 --> 00:00:26,304
而微调过的那个只有 62.93
and puts the fine-tuned one at 62.93.

7
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:29,729
那么哪种做法更好，微调还是冻结？
So which recipe is better, fine-tuning or freezing?

8
00:00:30,049 --> 00:00:33,569
而且光看这两张表，你能看出到底哪里不一样吗？
And from these two tables, can you even tell what was different?

9
00:00:33,889 --> 00:00:36,811
有一条线索看得见：看 epochs 这一列
One clue is visible: look at the epochs column.

10
00:00:37,131 --> 00:00:38,681
先记着这个问题
Hold that question.

11
00:00:38,731 --> 00:00:43,809
答案一部分在表里，另一部分在这张表从没写下的东西里
Part of the answer is in the table, and part of it is in what the table never wrote down.

12
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:46,781
然后，微调过的 MobileNet 离开 Colab
Then the fine-tuned MobileNet leaves Colab.

13
00:00:47,101 --> 00:00:49,588
它被打进一个 4 KB 的 tar 包
It gets packed into a 4 kilobyte tarball

14
00:00:49,588 --> 00:00:54,375
在一台只租一个任务那么久的机器上训练，只用一条命令
and trains on a machine you rent for the length of one job, from one command.

15
00:00:54,695 --> 00:00:57,170
这条命令里带着你的 W&B 密钥
That command carries your W&B key.

16
00:00:57,417 --> 00:01:02,185
跟着做，你需要两份带免费 T4 GPU 的 Colab 拷贝
To follow along you need two Colab copies with a free T4 GPU,

17
00:01:02,185 --> 00:01:04,530
一个免费的 W&B 账号、Docker
a free account on W&B, Docker,

18
00:01:04,530 --> 00:01:07,657
以及一个开通了结算的 Google Cloud 项目
and a Google Cloud project with billing.

19
00:01:07,977 --> 00:01:10,913
Vertex AI 任务在运行期间会花钱
Vertex AI jobs cost money while they run;

20
00:01:10,913 --> 00:01:13,993
金色标签标出每一个计费点，不写金额
gold tags mark each point, without amounts.

21
00:01:14,313 --> 00:01:16,524
黄色标签的意思是：暂停一下，自己跑一遍
A yellow tag means pause and run it,

22
00:01:16,524 --> 00:01:18,857
每条命令都在学习指南里
and the study guide has every command.

23
00:01:19,177 --> 00:01:23,678
今天的两个关键词，来自课上：可复现和可追责
Today's two words, from the lecture: reproducibility and accountability.

24
00:01:24,717 --> 00:01:28,452
课上从让深度学习变好的三个杠杆讲起
The lecture starts from three levers for better deep learning:

25
00:01:28,452 --> 00:01:31,224
更多数据、更好的模型、更快的硬件
more data, better models, and faster hardware.

26
00:01:31,544 --> 00:01:34,338
今天拉第三个：你去租硬件
Today we pull the third one: you rent hardware.

27
00:01:34,658 --> 00:01:37,368
再加上能看出它有没有用的记账
And you add the bookkeeping that shows whether it helped.

28
00:01:37,617 --> 00:01:39,252
在 Cheese App 的路线图上
On the Cheese App roadmap,

29
00:01:39,252 --> 00:01:43,718
围住实验追踪和基线模型的那个虚线框，就是今天
the dashed box around experiment tracking and baseline models is today.

30
00:01:44,038 --> 00:01:46,726
你的第三个项目里程碑要的正是这个
Your third milestone asks for exactly this.

31
00:01:46,967 --> 00:01:49,250
一个实验的每一部分该放在哪里？
Where does each piece of an experiment go?

32
00:01:49,570 --> 00:01:54,017
代码放 GitHub，数据放第 11 讲的版本管理
Code to GitHub, data to the versioning from lecture 11,

33
00:01:54,017 --> 00:01:58,060
环境放 pyproject.toml 和 uv.lock
and the environment to pyproject.toml and uv.lock.

34
00:01:58,380 --> 00:02:01,047
权重、指标和日志还没有地方放
Weights, metrics and logs have no home yet.

35
00:02:01,367 --> 00:02:04,138
一个完整的 run 应该存下七样东西
A complete run should keep seven things:

36
00:02:04,138 --> 00:02:08,364
环境、代码、数据、模型、指标、产物和笔记
environment, code, data, model, metrics, artifacts and notes.

37
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:13,976
课程用的是 Weights & Biases，简称 W&B，它帮你托管
The course uses Weights & Biases, W&B for short, which is hosted for you.

38
00:02:14,296 --> 00:02:18,307
MLflow 是常见的选择，用在你必须自己托管的时候
MLflow is the usual choice if you must host it yourself.

39
00:02:18,550 --> 00:02:19,929
这是地图
Here is the map.

40
00:02:19,979 --> 00:02:24,966
上面是 Colab 这条线：notebook A 把文件装进一个目录再上传
On top, the Colab lane: notebook A fills a folder and uploads it,

41
00:02:24,966 --> 00:02:27,958
notebook B 把它的 run 实时传到 W&B
and notebook B streams its runs to W&B.

42
00:02:28,278 --> 00:02:33,801
下面是 repo 这条线：你的笔记本打包代码，bucket 存着它
Below, the repo lane: your laptop packs the code, a bucket holds it,

43
00:02:33,801 --> 00:02:37,537
Vertex AI 运行它，这个 run 向 W&B 汇报
Vertex AI runs it, and the run reports to W&B.

44
00:02:37,857 --> 00:02:39,457
今天两条线都点亮
Today we light both.

45
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:46,096
从课程页面打开 notebook A，另存一份，把运行时切到 GPU
Open notebook A from the course page, save a copy, and switch the runtime to a GPU;

46
00:02:46,096 --> 00:02:47,696
暂停一下，把它配好
pause and set it up.

47
00:02:47,916 --> 00:02:52,311
它保存下来的输出，是授课老师在一块 Tesla T4 上的那次运行
Its stored outputs show the instructors' run on one Tesla T4.

48
00:02:53,667 --> 00:02:55,606
跑数据集的单元格
Run the dataset cells:

49
00:02:55,606 --> 00:03:01,070
1156 张照片，来自一个 GitHub release，有四个奶酪 label
1,156 photos from one GitHub release, with four cheese labels.

50
00:03:01,390 --> 00:03:02,940
记住它们的顺序
Remember their order.

51
00:03:02,990 --> 00:03:09,987
然后是划分：936 张用来训练，104 张用来验证，116 张用来测试
Then the split: 936 to train, 104 to validate, 116 to test.

52
00:03:10,307 --> 00:03:11,750
暂停一下，把它们跑一遍
Pause and run them.

53
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:13,400
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

54
00:03:13,464 --> 00:03:18,151
这个单元格把 validation percent 设成 0.2
The cell sets validation_percent to 0.2,

55
00:03:18,151 --> 00:03:22,253
可验证集只有 1156 张里的 104 张
yet validation is 104 out of 1,156.

56
00:03:22,573 --> 00:03:24,323
这段代码实际上做了什么？
What did the code actually do?

57
00:03:33,167 --> 00:03:35,130
两次划分用的都是 test percent
Both splits use test_percent.

58
00:03:35,450 --> 00:03:39,840
1156 的 10% 是 116 张，用来测试
10 percent of 1,156 is 116 for testing,

59
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:47,268
剩下 1040 张的 10% 是 104 张，也就是验证集
then 10 percent of the remaining 1,040 is 104, the validation set.

60
00:03:47,588 --> 00:03:50,447
一个小疏漏，还被复制进了 repo 的训练脚本
A small slip, copied into the repo trainer.

61
00:03:50,683 --> 00:03:52,461
现在看自己动手做的实验追踪工具
Now the home-made tracker.

62
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:56,592
第 31 个单元格建了一个目录，用当前的 Unix 时间命名
Cell 31 makes a folder named after the current Unix time.

63
00:03:56,912 --> 00:03:58,514
每个模型训练完
After each model trains,

64
00:03:58,514 --> 00:04:03,386
第 12 个单元格里的辅助函数就往目录里放五个文件
the helper from cell 12 drops five files into it: the model, its weights,

65
00:04:03,386 --> 00:04:06,256
模型、权重、结构、训练历史和指标
its structure, its history and its metrics.

66
00:04:06,576 --> 00:04:08,582
暂停一下，把五个模型训练一遍
Pause and train the five models.

67
00:04:09,367 --> 00:04:12,913
第 54 个单元格把指标文件汇总成一张表
Cell 54 gathers the metric files into one table,

68
00:04:12,913 --> 00:04:16,459
第 56 个单元格把第一行当成最好的模型
and cell 56 picks its top row as the best model;

69
00:04:16,459 --> 00:04:19,266
暂停一下，一直跑到预测那几个单元格
pause and run through the predictions.

70
00:04:19,586 --> 00:04:25,332
有一个小疏漏：准确率在排序前变成了文本，所以按字符串排序
A small slip: accuracy becomes text before sorting, so it sorts strings;

71
00:04:25,332 --> 00:04:28,524
9.5% 会排在 68% 前面
9.5 percent would rank above 68 percent.

72
00:04:28,767 --> 00:04:30,367
先给第一个答案
Here is a first answer.

73
00:04:30,580 --> 00:04:36,191
这个目录存了设置和分数，却没存哪 116 张照片是测试集
The folder keeps settings and scores, but not which 116 photos were the test set.

74
00:04:36,511 --> 00:04:41,460
划分没有随机种子，所以每次运行都拿不同的 116 张来评分
The split has no seed, so every run is graded on a different 116.

75
00:04:41,780 --> 00:04:44,326
一张照片值 0.86 个百分点
One photo is worth 0.86 points,

76
00:04:44,326 --> 00:04:48,351
而 notebook A 的冠军只领先两张照片
and the winner in notebook A leads by two photos.

77
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:50,403
用第 62 个单元格登录
Sign in with cell 62,

78
00:04:50,403 --> 00:04:54,140
在第 63 个单元格里填上你自己的项目和 bucket
put your own project and bucket into cell 63,

79
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:55,740
再跑第 66 个单元格
and run cell 66.

80
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:57,549
你的任何一个 bucket 都行
Any bucket of yours works;

81
00:04:57,549 --> 00:05:02,253
要是还没有，先跳过这次上传，等准备工作那一章建好再回来
if you have none yet, skip this upload and come back after the setup chapter.

82
00:05:02,573 --> 00:05:03,995
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

83
00:05:04,045 --> 00:05:07,579
金色标签：这些文件现在放在你的 bucket 里
A gold tag: those files now sit in your bucket,

84
00:05:07,579 --> 00:05:11,640
每个模型 10 到 104 MB 的权重，外加一份拷贝
10 to 104 megabytes of weights per model, plus a copy.

85
00:05:12,683 --> 00:05:14,752
Notebook B 加上了 W&B
Notebook B adds W&B.

86
00:05:15,072 --> 00:05:19,638
它的第一个单元格安装 W&B，-U 参数的意思是装最新版
Its first cell installs it, and the -U flag means whatever is newest.

87
00:05:19,958 --> 00:05:24,226
在我们没有登录的替身里额外检查一下
An extra check in our signed-out stand-in shows

88
00:05:24,226 --> 00:05:30,219
录制时是 0.31.0，而保存下来的那次运行用的是 0.22.2
0.31.0 at the time of recording, while the stored run used 0.22.2.

89
00:05:30,539 --> 00:05:31,883
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
Pause and run it.

90
00:05:31,933 --> 00:05:35,933
数据相关的单元格，一直到第 32 个，都和 notebook A 一样
The data cells, through cell 32, match notebook A,

91
00:05:35,933 --> 00:05:41,213
但其中一个还会下载一个 zip 包，大约 510 MB，你根本用不上
but one also downloads a zip of about 510 megabytes you never use.

92
00:05:41,533 --> 00:05:44,413
你可以删掉那一行，然后暂停一下，把它们跑一遍
You may delete that line; then pause and run them.

93
00:05:44,650 --> 00:05:48,703
在 W&B 的 User Settings 里复制你的 API key
Copy your API key from the user settings on W&B.

94
00:05:49,023 --> 00:05:52,270
在 Colab 里打开钥匙图标，添加一个 secret
In Colab, open the key icon and add a secret

95
00:05:52,270 --> 00:05:56,106
名字和画面上一字不差，并打开 Notebook access
named exactly as on screen, with notebook access on.

96
00:05:56,426 --> 00:05:58,026
暂停一下，加上你自己的
Pause and add yours.

97
00:05:58,133 --> 00:06:00,074
第 34 个单元格用它登录
Cell 34 signs in with it.

98
00:06:00,316 --> 00:06:02,812
现在暂停一下，把五个训练单元格跑一遍
Now pause and run the five training cells.

99
00:06:03,132 --> 00:06:05,666
每个单元格都用 wandb.init 开启自己的 run
Each starts its run with wandb.init in one project,

100
00:06:05,666 --> 00:06:07,593
都在同一个项目 cheese-app-demo 里
cheese-app-demo.

101
00:06:07,868 --> 00:06:12,690
在账本里，这五行变成了五个 run，共用一条 epoch 轴
In the ledger, the five rows become five runs on one shared epoch axis.

102
00:06:12,933 --> 00:06:15,216
可是只有 2 block 那个 run 有曲线
But only the 2_block run shows curves.

103
00:06:15,536 --> 00:06:18,138
把它的 model.fit 调用和另一个单元格的比一比
Compare its model.fit call with another cell's.

104
00:06:18,458 --> 00:06:21,146
来想一个问题：另外四个缺了什么？
Something to ponder: what do the other four lack?

105
00:06:27,983 --> 00:06:31,695
一个 callback：model.fit 在每个 epoch 之后调用的代码
A callback: code that model.fit calls after every epoch.

106
00:06:32,015 --> 00:06:35,604
只有 2 block 那个单元格传了 W&B 的 callback
Only the 2_block cell passes the W&B callback,

107
00:06:35,604 --> 00:06:39,738
所以只有它的 loss 和准确率一个 epoch 一个 epoch 地传过来
so only its loss and accuracy arrive, epoch by epoch.

108
00:06:40,058 --> 00:06:44,239
没有 callback，wandb.init 只给你系统图表，从不给你的曲线
Without one, wandb.init gives you system charts, never your curves.

109
00:06:44,483 --> 00:06:48,920
两个 MobileNet 的 run 名字一样，所以要靠 run ID 区分
Both MobileNet runs share one name, so tell them apart by run ID.

110
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:51,481
没有哪个单元格结束最后一个 run
No cell finishes the last run,

111
00:06:51,481 --> 00:06:54,766
所以在第 52 个单元格后面加上 wandb.finish，这是额外步骤
so add wandb.finish after cell 52, an extra.

112
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:59,105
第 55 个单元格生成了开头的第二张表
Cell 55 builds the second table from the opening.

113
00:06:59,425 --> 00:07:02,720
微调过的 MobileNet 在这里训练了 10 个 epoch
The fine-tuned MobileNet trained 10 epochs here

114
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:05,804
在 notebook A 里是 15 个：这不是公平的比较
and 15 in notebook A: not a fair comparison.

115
00:07:06,124 --> 00:07:12,343
再看冻结的 MobileNet，设置和 epoch 都一样
Now the frozen MobileNet, with the same settings and epochs:

116
00:07:12,343 --> 00:07:15,660
notebook A 里是 67.24，这里是 68.97
67.24 in notebook A, 68.97 here.

117
00:07:15,980 --> 00:07:20,268
光凭运气就差了两张照片：正好是冠军领先的差距
Two photos apart by chance alone: the size of the winning margin.

118
00:07:20,516 --> 00:07:27,071
要上传的话，改第 13 个单元格里的 bucket 和项目并重跑它
To upload, edit the bucket and project inside cell 13 and run cell 13 again,

119
00:07:27,071 --> 00:07:29,227
然后跑第 64 和第 66 个单元格
then run cells 64 and 66;

120
00:07:29,227 --> 00:07:30,827
暂停一下，照着做
pause and do it.

121
00:07:35,150 --> 00:07:39,715
课上把这个写法画成三行，包在不变的训练代码外面
The lecture shows the pattern as three lines around unchanged training code.

122
00:07:40,035 --> 00:07:41,977
用 wandb.init 开启 run
Start the run with wandb.init.

123
00:07:42,297 --> 00:07:45,454
在 model.fit 里用 callback 盯住模型
Watch the model with a callback inside model.fit.

124
00:07:45,774 --> 00:07:47,715
最后在训练结束时结束这个 run
And finish the run when training ends.

125
00:07:47,950 --> 00:07:49,906
现在看 notebook B 里真正的单元格
Now notebook B's real cell.

126
00:07:50,126 --> 00:07:54,093
它先开启 run，然后把一个字典赋给 wandb.config
It starts the run, then assigns a dictionary to wandb.config,

127
00:07:54,093 --> 00:07:56,825
给 run 改名，再调用 wandb.run.save
renames the run, and calls wandb.run.save.

128
00:07:57,067 --> 00:07:58,667
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

129
00:07:58,731 --> 00:08:02,869
经过这次赋值，再加上后面用执行时间做的一次 update
After that assignment, and a later update with the execution time,

130
00:08:02,869 --> 00:08:04,875
这个 run 的 config 里有什么？
what does the run's config hold?

131
00:08:13,717 --> 00:08:15,075
盯住这个名字
Watch the name.

132
00:08:15,125 --> 00:08:16,444
调用 wandb.init
The call wandb.init

133
00:08:16,444 --> 00:08:20,330
会让 wandb.config 这个名字指向这个 run 的 config 抽屉
points the name wandb.config at the run's config drawer.

134
00:08:20,650 --> 00:08:23,105
这次赋值并没有装满那个抽屉
The assignment does not fill that drawer;

135
00:08:23,105 --> 00:08:25,920
它把名字挪到了一个新的、散落在外的字典上
it moves the name onto a new, loose dictionary.

136
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:31,167
接着 update 写进的是那个散落的字典，run 结束时抽屉还是空的
The update then writes into the loose one, and the run finishes with its drawer empty.

137
00:08:31,417 --> 00:08:35,961
证据：用今天的 W&B，开离线模式，作为我们的替身
The proof, on today's W&B in offline mode, as our stand-in.

138
00:08:36,281 --> 00:08:39,993
这个名字指向一个普通的 dict，而 run 的 config 是空的
The name points at a plain dict, and the run's config is empty.

139
00:08:40,313 --> 00:08:43,953
修法是把这个字典直接传给 wandb.init
The fix passes the dictionary to wandb.init itself,

140
00:08:43,953 --> 00:08:48,163
这样 config 里就有全部四个键，再加上执行时间
and the config holds all four keys plus the execution time.

141
00:08:51,650 --> 00:08:54,291
调用 wandb.run.save 加上 test 这个词
The call wandb.run.save with the word test

142
00:08:54,291 --> 00:08:56,051
会上传名字匹配 test 的文件
uploads files matching test;

143
00:08:56,051 --> 00:08:57,651
它并不保存这个 run
it does not save the run.

144
00:08:57,867 --> 00:09:01,737
这个 repo 的训练脚本把第一行和最后一行写对了
The repo's trainer gets the first and last lines right:

145
00:09:01,737 --> 00:09:05,184
config 放在 wandb.init 里，然后是 update 和 finish
config inside wandb.init, then update and finish.

146
00:09:05,504 --> 00:09:07,104
可中间那一行没了
But the middle line is gone.

147
00:09:07,424 --> 00:09:12,822
2025 年 10 月的一次 commit 删掉了这个 callback，没说原因
One commit in October 2025 removed the callback, without saying why.

148
00:09:13,142 --> 00:09:17,133
所以它的 run 有 config 和系统图表，没有曲线
So its runs get config and system charts, and no curves;

149
00:09:17,133 --> 00:09:19,627
练习 1 会把 callback 加回去
exercise 1 adds the callback again.

150
00:09:20,667 --> 00:09:23,472
课的后半部分讲 Vertex AI
The second half of the lecture is Vertex AI,

151
00:09:23,472 --> 00:09:26,086
也就是 Google Cloud 的机器学习平台
Google Cloud's machine learning platform.

152
00:09:26,406 --> 00:09:30,021
控制台里有三个入口要紧：Workbench 管 notebook
Three console entries matter: Workbench for notebooks,

153
00:09:30,021 --> 00:09:33,168
Training 管任务，Pipelines 管工作流
Training for jobs, and Pipelines for workflows.

154
00:09:33,488 --> 00:09:36,690
今天用的是 Training，在 Custom jobs 标签页上
Today is Training, on the custom jobs tab;

155
00:09:36,690 --> 00:09:38,672
第 15 讲用 Pipelines
lecture 15 uses Pipelines.

156
00:09:38,917 --> 00:09:42,906
无服务器训练的意思是：只在训练这一步租用硬件
Serverless training means you rent the hardware only for the training step.

157
00:09:43,226 --> 00:09:46,896
没人去搭服务器，计费在这一步结束时就停了
Nobody sets up a server, and billing stops when the step ends.

158
00:09:47,216 --> 00:09:50,586
机器还是有的，你只是不用管它的生命周期
There is still a machine; you just don't manage its lifetime.

159
00:09:50,834 --> 00:09:54,173
第一步：把 notebook 里的代码搬进一个 Python 文件
Step one: move the notebook code into a Python file,

160
00:09:54,173 --> 00:09:56,935
再把写死的选项改成命令行参数
and turn its hard-coded choices into flags.

161
00:09:57,255 --> 00:10:00,693
这些参数是 epoch 数、batch 大小和模型名
The flags are epochs, batch size and model name,

162
00:10:00,693 --> 00:10:03,058
再加上 train base 和你的 W&B 密钥
plus train_base and your W&B key.

163
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:07,576
第二步把这个文件打成一个 tar 包，也就是一个压缩归档文件
Step two packs that file into a tarball, one compressed archive,

164
00:10:07,576 --> 00:10:09,380
再上传到一个 bucket
and uploads it to a bucket.

165
00:10:09,700 --> 00:10:15,165
第三步在课上叫作 Model Trainer CLI Container 的地方运行
Step three runs from what the lecture calls the Model Trainer CLI Container,

166
00:10:15,165 --> 00:10:19,193
也就是你笔记本上的驾驶舱：它向 Vertex AI 申请一个任务
our cockpit on your laptop: it asks Vertex AI for a job.

167
00:10:19,513 --> 00:10:24,420
然后 Vertex AI 启动一台机器，只有 CPU，或者带一块 T4
Vertex AI then starts a machine, CPU only or with one T4.

168
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:28,858
它加载 Google 预构建的 TensorFlow image，安装你的 tar 包
It loads Google's prebuilt TensorFlow image, installs your tarball,

169
00:10:28,858 --> 00:10:32,484
用你的参数运行你的训练脚本，然后删掉这台机器
runs your trainer with your flags, and deletes the machine.

170
00:10:32,734 --> 00:10:35,017
有两个事实决定了后面的一切
Two facts drive everything after this.

171
00:10:35,337 --> 00:10:39,245
任务看不到你的笔记本：它的数据来自网上
The job cannot see your laptop: its data comes from the internet,

172
00:10:39,245 --> 00:10:42,974
任何要留下来的东西都必须写到某个持久的地方
and anything it should keep must be written somewhere durable.

173
00:10:43,294 --> 00:10:45,704
而且 image 是 Google 的，不是你的
And the image is Google's, not yours.

174
00:10:45,950 --> 00:10:47,500
快速预测一下
A quick prediction.

175
00:10:47,550 --> 00:10:50,878
你的笔记本没有 GPU，也没有 TensorFlow
Your laptop has no GPU and no TensorFlow.

176
00:10:51,198 --> 00:10:54,782
这张图里，哪些机器会 import TensorFlow？
Which machines in this picture will ever import TensorFlow?

177
00:10:59,617 --> 00:11:04,353
两个：Colab 运行时，以及每个 Vertex 任务里的 container
Two: the Colab runtime, and the container inside each Vertex job.

178
00:11:04,673 --> 00:11:08,449
从来不是你笔记本上的驾驶舱；讲 tar 包的那一章会证明这一点
Never the cockpit on your laptop; the tarball chapter proves it.

179
00:11:09,483 --> 00:11:12,352
把 model-training 这个 repo clone 下来，再进去
Clone the model-training repo and move into it;

180
00:11:12,352 --> 00:11:13,742
暂停一下，自己跑一遍
pause and run it.

181
00:11:13,792 --> 00:11:16,909
两个额外检查显示课程 pin 住的版本，以及 repo 里的文件
Two extras show the course pin and the repo's files.

182
00:11:24,316 --> 00:11:27,687
在控制台里启用 Vertex AI API
In the console, enable the Vertex AI API.

183
00:11:28,007 --> 00:11:31,484
然后申请 GPU 配额，也就是每个区域的额度
Then request GPU quota, an allowance per region.

184
00:11:31,804 --> 00:11:35,984
筛选 custom model training，选 T4 GPU
Filter for custom model training, pick T4 GPUs,

185
00:11:35,984 --> 00:11:39,451
包含 us-central1，也就是 cli.sh 运行的区域
include us-central1, where cli.sh runs,

186
00:11:39,451 --> 00:11:41,852
设一个新的上限，然后提交
set a new limit and submit.

187
00:11:42,172 --> 00:11:43,722
暂停一下，两件都做了
Pause and do both.

188
00:11:43,772 --> 00:11:47,313
审批可能要好几个小时，也可能被拒
Approval may take hours or be refused;

189
00:11:47,313 --> 00:11:50,108
cli.sh 没有配额也能在 CPU 上跑
cli.sh runs on CPU without it.

190
00:11:50,350 --> 00:11:54,257
接下来，在 repo 旁边建一个 secrets 目录，绝不放在里面
Next, a secrets folder beside the repo, never inside it;

191
00:11:54,257 --> 00:11:55,857
暂停一下，建好它
pause and make it.

192
00:11:58,866 --> 00:12:03,164
然后是身份：一个叫 model-trainer 的服务账号
Then the identity: a service account model-trainer

193
00:12:03,164 --> 00:12:06,345
角色是 Storage Admin、AI Platform Admin
with Storage Admin, AI Platform Admin

194
00:12:06,345 --> 00:12:08,752
和 Vertex AI Administrator
and Vertex AI Administrator,

195
00:12:08,752 --> 00:12:13,565
再在 secrets 里存一个 JSON 密钥：model-trainer.json
and one JSON key saved in secrets as model-trainer.json.

196
00:12:13,885 --> 00:12:15,485
暂停一下，建一个你自己的
Pause and create yours.

197
00:12:19,300 --> 00:12:20,807
如实说一句
One honest note.

198
00:12:20,857 --> 00:12:24,763
这台录制用的机器没有 Google 凭据
This recording machine has no Google credentials,

199
00:12:24,763 --> 00:12:27,791
没有 W&B 账号，没有 GPU，也没有浏览器
no W&B account, no GPU and no browser.

200
00:12:28,111 --> 00:12:31,900
列表里的那个密钥是一个明显无效的替身
The key in that listing is an obviously invalid stand-in,

201
00:12:31,900 --> 00:12:34,425
在 container 启动之前就被移走了
moved out before the container starts.

202
00:12:34,745 --> 00:12:38,470
所以每个云端步骤都展示放错位置的密钥会带来的失败
So each cloud step shows the failure a misplaced key gives,

203
00:12:38,470 --> 00:12:40,868
成功的结果都注明出处
and successes come from named sources.

204
00:12:41,116 --> 00:12:44,529
然后用你自己的名字建一个 bucket；暂停一下，建好它
Then create a bucket with your own name; pause and create it.

205
00:12:44,849 --> 00:12:49,894
两个额外检查说明了原因：我们的占位名返回 404，它根本不存在
Two extras show why: our placeholder returns 404, it exists nowhere,

206
00:12:49,894 --> 00:12:54,641
而 README 里的名字返回 401，它属于别人
while the README's name returns 401, it belongs to someone else.

207
00:12:54,961 --> 00:12:59,015
金色标签：这个 bucket 存着你的代码和实验目录
A gold tag: the bucket stores your code and experiment folders.

208
00:12:59,250 --> 00:13:00,842
最后，复制你的 W&B 密钥
Last, copy your W&B key

209
00:13:00,842 --> 00:13:04,925
在起 container 要用的那个终端里 export 它
and export it in the terminal you'll use for the container.

210
00:13:05,245 --> 00:13:06,688
暂停一下，照着做
Pause and do it.

211
00:13:06,738 --> 00:13:10,471
额外用 echo 打印它的长度，我们的占位密钥是 40
An extra echo prints its length, 40 for our placeholder.

212
00:13:10,791 --> 00:13:15,826
它不能是 0；训练脚本 pin 住的 wandb，只接受正好 40 个字符
It must not be zero, and the trainer's pinned wandb accepts exactly 40.

213
00:13:16,146 --> 00:13:18,800
如果你的长度不一样，先继续往下做
If yours is a different length, keep going,

214
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:23,058
但提交任务之前，要先看“谁提交，谁运行”那一章
but watch the chapter Who submits, who runs, before you submit a job.

215
00:13:24,133 --> 00:13:25,733
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

216
00:13:25,797 --> 00:13:29,573
你 export 了密钥，关掉那个终端，又开了一个新的
You exported the key, closed that terminal, and opened a new one.

217
00:13:29,893 --> 00:13:31,792
同样的 echo 现在会打印什么？
What does the same echo print now?

218
00:13:38,633 --> 00:13:43,156
0：export 过的变量，只存在于那个 shell 和它的子进程里
Zero: an exported variable exists only in that shell and its children.

219
00:13:43,476 --> 00:13:46,932
第一部分完成了：密钥设好了，bucket 也有名字了
Part 1 is done: the key is set, the bucket has a name.

220
00:13:47,252 --> 00:13:50,366
接下来我们构建驾驶舱，而今天它构建不了
Next, we build the cockpit, and today it won't build.
